WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:03.840
The women's game in Afghanistan is in trouble.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:08.380
Several players have come out exposing alleged
sexual abuse inside the country's football

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:09.380
federation.

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:15.390
A former women's executive team member and
captain says she witnessed first-hand the

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:19.630
sexual harassment of members on the national
team back at a training camp in Jordan.

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:26.120
Two male representatives were drunk and went
to one of the player's rooms and tried to

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.750
touch one of their bodies.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.380
Po-pal said she immediately complained to
the federation's president.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:36.210
But instead of getting fired, the two men
were promoted.

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:45.399
We found out that one of those men became
the head of legal committee or department

00:00:45.399 --> 00:00:48.380
of Afghanistan's football association.

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:56.160
And the other became one of the responsible
persons for the U17 men's national team.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:01:00.989
The Afghan football federation has denied
all the allegations, and hinted Po-pal had

00:01:00.989 --> 00:01:02.660
an axe to grind.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:06.440
While Popal was team manager, everything was
fine.

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:13.140
But after she was sacked, then the women's
team becomes bad and abusive.

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:16.780
Po-pal was so concerned that she contacted
FIFA.

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:26.170
I reported in April 2018 and it took like
forever.

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:37.799
FLASH We want to put pressure on FIFA to start
the investigation and to help the victims.

00:01:37.799 --> 00:01:43.890
FIFA says it has a quote "zero tolerance"
policy on such matters and has reportedly

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:46.930
even involved the United Nations.

00:01:46.930 --> 00:01:51.380
As some aspects of these allegations involve
sensitive topics linked to the protection

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:56.140
of those involved, we have sought support
from relevant parties who willingly offered

00:01:56.140 --> 00:02:01.090
their support to FIFA
A scandal of this magnitude threatens the

00:02:01.090 --> 00:02:04.529
development of women's football in Aghanistan.

